  "task": {
    "objective": "Transport three physical cargo contracts through a shared narrow canal. Each contract owner receives its own outcome while every role also shares part of every delivery or loss.",
    "natural_termination": "All three cargo items are delivered or lost, otherwise horizon 80. Natural completion takes priority at the horizon.",
    "interaction": "Momentum persists under coast; turning while moving first reduces speed. Cell reservations block head-on passage and swaps. An empty tug can tow a laden follower at speed two while paying extra fuel; either partner can brake or release. Collisions damage carried cargo and can permanently remove future delivery opportunities.",
    "observation_access": "All boats, committed headings, speeds, fuel, tethers, cargo and destinations are public. Flat observations repeat the complete public state and append an own-role one-hot. Every active entity is visible to each role, fixed map is public, and resolved cargo retains public final status/position in the observation."
